5: const C={watch:['◷','The stopped watch','8:17 · For June. E.','An old brass pocket watch, warm from being carried. The hands stopped at 8:17. On its back: “For June. 8:17. E.”'],photo:['▧','The photograph','Two young friends at the station','A sun-faded photograph. On its back: “June says the 8:17 is lucky. —E.” The young man wears this same watch chain.'],timetable:['▤','The 8:17 timetable','The last train out, on a wet Tuesday','The 8:17 was the last train toward the coast. A pencilled note: “Platform 2. Don’t be late this time.”'],mechanism:['⚙','A careful repair','The case has been opened before','Theo finds a seam behind the inner case. The watch was stopped by hand, not broken. Something thin is hidden inside.'],letter:['✉','Elias’s unsent letter','A letter folded behind the watch face','“June — Father took ill that afternoon. I could not leave him alone, not even for one journey. I thought I would write tomorrow, when I had the words. Tomorrow became years. I kept your watch, and the place beside me on the train. I am sorry I let silence tell the story for me. —Elias.”']};
6: const people={Mara:['M','rust-red coat, rain-bright curls','Warm, thoughtful; often finds the right question a moment late.'],June:['J','silver hair and station-blue scarf','Measured and exact; when moved, her sentences get shorter.'],Theo:['T','brass spectacles, tool-filled waistcoat','Delighted by mechanism; speaks to clocks as if they are shy animals.'],Rowan:['R','moss-green shawl, book basket','Dryly kind, observant, never in a hurry to finish a thought.']};
