10: function menu(){modal.innerHTML=`<div class="menu-card"><div class="menu-title">THE LITTLE<br>THINGS</div><div class="menu-subtitle">A STORY IN FOUR PLACES</div><p>A rain-soft mystery about a watch, a train that left, and the things we almost said.</p>${S.started?'<button class="action" data-a="resume">Continue your story</button>':''}<button class="action" data-a="new">${S.started?'Begin again':'Open the shop'}</button><button class="action secondary" data-a="settings">Settings & controls</button><div style="font-size:9px;color:#c5b895;margin-top:18px">WASD / arrows · E interact · J journal · B clue board</div></div>`}
